  "name": "Question 11",
  "problem": "If $\\overset{\\to }{v}=⟨8,-7⟩$, then $3\\overset{\\to }{v}=$",
  "worked_solution": "To compute the result, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3\\overset{\\to }{v} & =3\\cdot ⟨8,-7⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3\\cdot 8,3\\cdot (-7)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨24,-21⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$",
